Subject: [PATCH] MiuiCamera: use normal Leica mode icon resources

The top bar and expanded Leica controls use separate drawable resource IDs.
Route both pairs through ResourcesCompat and carry the original 5.3 Leica
vectors in the APK and RRO so the stock white placeholders are not used.
